{"id":"ausser","lemma":"außer","pos":"prep","rank":417,"glosses":["except; besides; apart from","out of","beside oneself"],"ipa":"/ˈaʊ̯sɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/De-au%C3%9Fer.ogg/De-au%C3%9Fer.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Außer mir war jeder eingeladen.","en":"Everyone except me was invited.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566967","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"to invite","l":"einladen"}]},{"text":"Sie ist gerade außer Haus.","en":"She is out now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69454","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"house, building"}]},{"text":"Außer mir ist niemand hier.","en":"There's no one but me here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/699100","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Nun war sie außer Gefahr.","en":"She was now out of danger.","words":[{"g":"now, at this moment"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"danger"}]},{"text":"Außer mir hat er keine Freunde.","en":"He has no friends besides me.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"friends"}]}]}